egory":"Sandwiches","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"Desserts","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"K4erLZcvyz7g1QgO91v7FA","review_id":"bIoY_K2YgOsuFBBwKP8RhQ","date":"2018-12-11T19:54:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9418694972991943,"text_excerpt":"My friend and I went for lunch to the St. Roch Market food hall and we happened upon Doily for dessert. They are the first vendor on the right when you enter the building. I walked by and saw the owner had just pulled out some massive Chocolate Chip Cookies. They looked awesome. I bought us one to split. It was melt in your mouth delicious! It had both Milk Chocolate Chips and White Chocolate Chips baked into it. We saw someone else buy a piece of the Chocolate Cake. It was equally huge and looked very good. I look forward to coming back here and trying some of their sandwiches."},{"business_id":"K4erLZcvyz7g1QgO91v7FA","review_id":"WdGjWimb8C7XB8Vy8egWUw","date":"2019-08-08T23:02:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.91725754737854,"text_excerpt":"The owner of @doilynola told me I had to try this cookie because it was the #bestcookiever, butttttt I didn't even really want to accept it because 1) I don't love cookies like that 2) I don't even really like any sweets like that 3) her \"best cookie ever\" might just be \"meh\" to me, and then she'd be sad . : : Then I tasted the cookie, and it is definitely the best cookie I've ever tasted. My wife says it tastes like a \"mall cookie but better\", and I kind of know what she's getting at. It's crispy and chewy at the same time, and it will make you want to fight someone for the edges. She made sure to explain, \"No, mall cookies be rollin.\" This cookie rolls. Title of best cookie ever is well..."},{"business_id":"K4erLZcvyz7g1QgO91v7FA","review_id":"9V46U8h7pgCLZlleVisIiw","date":"2018-12-20T01:31:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.913948655128479,"text_excerpt":"Our group grazed on a piece of their chocolate cake which is huge and share worthy. This was one of the best chocolate cakes I've ever had in my life: moist, not too sweet, very chocalatey, rich but not heavy with frosting that was flavorful but not super sweet. It was perfection and clearly made with love. One of my friends said he was coming back to St Roch Market the next day just for that cake. Exceptional!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"K4erLZcvyz7g1QgO91v7FA","photo_id":"xDxqkihzafUh84dTzwrWhg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/xDxqkihzafUh84dTzwrWhg.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
